		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Damage:</strong> 2d6 Piercing</p><p><strong>Properties:</strong> Reach 6, Light, Ammo 6</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 60 gp</p><hr><p><strong>Firearm properties</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Ammo N.</strong> Must spend 1 Action reloading after being fired a number of times equal to its Ammo.</li><li><strong>Precise.</strong> Crits on an 8+ if the roll has advantage.</li><li><strong>Scatter.</strong> Targets farther than 1 space away take half damage.</li></ul><p><em>Engineer firearm. Only Engineers are proficient with firearms.</em></p><hr><p><em>[A] Ammo is a counter on this firearm, tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes): each attack spends 1 and is refused when it is empty. It refills after combat and on a Safe Rest; Hidden Pistol and Elemental Munition each add +1 max Ammo, and Elemental Munition reloads it.</em></p><p><em>[A] The firearm must be equipped for its Ammo counter to exist (Nimble switches off an unequipped object's rules).</em></p><p><em>[M] Reloading costs 1 Action: spend it, then refill the counter from the sheet (click it → set to max).</em></p><p><em>[M] Precise / Scatter are not automated: Precise crits on 8+ with advantage; Scatter halves damage beyond 1 space.</em></p>",
